Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:50.99,Headline,,90,90,330,,Why do so many numbers start with {\c&H000B9EF5&}1{\c&H00FFFFFF&}?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.98,Caption,,140,140,1320,,Now here's something
